#: ../../../hwmon/ltc4283.rst:39
msgid ""
"The following attributes are supported. Limits are read-write and all the "
"other attributes are read-only. Note that the VADIOx channels might not be "
"available if the ADIO pins are used as GPIOs (naturally also affects the "
"respective differential channels)."
msgstr ""

